"\n"
"Freezes the screen and shows it full screen. Scroll to zoom, drag to draw, hold Shift for a straight line, Ctrl for a rectangle, Tab for an ellipse and Ctrl+Shift for an arrow. R, G, B, O, Y and P pick the color, T types text, W and K make a white or black board, E erases everything, Ctrl+Z undoes, Ctrl+C copies the picture, Ctrl+S saves it and Esc closes."
